<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Two lint findings that are wrong here, silenced with the reason rather than left to be
    "fixed" again by whoever reads the report next. Everything else lint says is still on.
-->
<lint>

    <!--
        "This folder configuration (v26) is unnecessary; minSdkVersion is 31. Merge all the
        resources in this folder into mipmap-anydpi."

        Following that advice removes the adaptive icon from the APK. Measured, not assumed:
        with mipmap-anydpi-v26 the packaged resource table carries

            mipmap/ic_launcher  (mdpi..xxxhdpi) webp  +  (anydpi) xml

        and after renaming the folder to mipmap-anydpi the anydpi entry is gone entirely, so
        every launcher falls back to the legacy square bitmap and draws it shrunk inside a
        white circle. That shipped in 0.2 and had to be undone.
    -->
    <issue id="ObsoleteSdkInt">
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26" />
    </issue>

    <!--
        ic_launcher_round is unused, and deliberately: the manifest declares no roundIcon,
        because an adaptive icon is already masked to whatever shape the launcher wants. It
        stays because it is what Asset Studio writes, so regenerating the icon does not show
        up as a diff, and because it costs six lines in a file the shrinker drops anyway.
    -->
    <issue id="UnusedResources">
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher_round.xml" />
    </issue>

    <!--
        "Custom view SwatchGrid is missing constructor used by tools: (Context, AttributeSet)."

        That constructor exists so a view can be inflated from a layout and previewed in the
        editor. This one is never inflated: it is constructed in code, by the settings screen,
        with the palette it is meant to draw - it has nothing to show without one. Adding the
        constructor would add a second way to build it that no caller uses and the preview
        would render an empty grid, which is a worse answer than no preview.
    -->
    <issue id="ViewConstructor">
        <ignore path="src/main/java/io/github/massimonastasi/freedoomlw/SwatchGrid.kt" />
    </issue>

</lint>
